extends layout

block title
  | TravelMate — Travel, thoughtfully planned

block content
  section.hero
    .hero-copy
      p.eyebrow Plan with a real travel professional
      h1 The details of your journey, finally in one place.
      p.hero-intro Bring destinations, day-by-day plans, proposed flights and clear cost estimates together with your travel agent. Review every detail, request changes and move forward when it feels right.
      .hero-actions
        a.button.button-primary(href='#how-it-works') How TravelMate works
        a.text-link(href='#agents') For travel agents
      p.hero-note Thoughtful trip planning, shaped around you.
    .hero-visual
      img.hero-image(src='https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1501785888041-af3ef285b470?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1500&q=85', alt='A lake and mountain landscape at sunrise')
      .image-label
        span.image-kicker YOUR JOURNEY, WELL PLANNED
        strong More clarity at every step
      .feature-card
        span.feature-card-label Everything in one proposal
        ul.feature-card-list
          li Day-by-day itinerary
          li Proposed flights and costs
          li Feedback and revisions

  section.promise-strip(aria-label='TravelMate benefits')
    .promise-item
      span.promise-icon(aria-hidden='true') 01
      span Work directly with a travel agent
    .promise-item
      span.promise-icon(aria-hidden='true') 02
      span Keep plans and estimates together
    .promise-item
      span.promise-icon(aria-hidden='true') 03
      span Review and refine before proceeding

  section.features-section#features
    .section-heading
      p.eyebrow A clearer way to plan
      h2 Your whole journey, thought through together.
      p Keep the moving parts of a trip connected, from the first itinerary draft through traveller feedback and agent approval.
    .features-grid
      article.product-card
        span.product-icon(aria-hidden='true') 01
        h3 Itineraries that make sense
        p Organise destinations, activities, places and travel notes into a day-by-day plan that is easy to review.
      article.product-card
        span.product-icon(aria-hidden='true') 02
        h3 Costs with context
        p See proposed flights, estimated costs, inclusions and exclusions together, with prices clearly identified as estimates.
      article.product-card
        span.product-icon(aria-hidden='true') 03
        h3 Inspiration in the right place
        p Keep destination video links alongside the itinerary, opening on their original public platforms.
      article.product-card
        span.product-icon(aria-hidden='true') 04
        h3 Feedback that moves plans forward
        p Request adjustments and review the updated proposal. Your travel agent manages revisions and approval.

  section.workflow-section#how-it-works
    .workflow-heading
      p.eyebrow Made to be shared
      h2 Plan it together. Review it at your pace.
    .workflow-steps
      article.workflow-step
        span.workflow-number 01
        h3 Your agent prepares the plan
        p Dates, destinations, activities and travel details come together in one proposal.
      article.workflow-step
        span.workflow-number 02
        h3 You review every detail
        p Follow the schedule, understand the estimates and tell your agent what you would like to change.
      article.workflow-step
        span.workflow-number 03
        h3 Your agent revises and confirms
        p The latest version is shared for your review. Your agent approves only after checking your confirmation.
    .approval-note
      span.approval-mark(aria-hidden='true') i
      p
        | Flight availability and prices can change. Estimates are not live quotes.
        strong A proposal or confirmation is not a booking.

  section.audience-section
    article.audience-card#travellers
      p.eyebrow For travellers
      h2 Feel confident in the plan.
      p See where you are going, what each day holds and how the estimated costs are put together. Ask for an adjustment before deciding how to proceed.
      a.text-link(href='#how-it-works') See how the process works
    article.audience-card.audience-card-dark#agents
      p.eyebrow For travel agents
      h2 Keep every proposal moving.
      p Organise plans from Draft to Shared to Approved. Keep itinerary details, traveller feedback and revisions connected as you work.
      a.text-link(href='#features') Explore TravelMate

  section.closing-section
    p.eyebrow A more personal way to travel
    h2 Good journeys start with a good conversation.
    p Bring your ideas to your travel agent. TravelMate helps you shape the details together.
    a.button.button-light(href='#how-it-works') Discover the process

  footer.site-footer
    a.brand(href='/', aria-label='TravelMate home')
      span.brand-mark(aria-hidden='true')
      span TravelMate
    p Travel planning, made personal.
    a.footer-link(href='#main-content') Back to top ↑
